sercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOsNFsyVw2szW6v6_OE00PokII6wSk427f2G15_lRwk6v2V93zJsAcKz9vTrOajYONwv1_NsGzjPgsJypgrNxXY8ulhrHiAncbCfmzJ31w5mHqZ4NkgP3EwPCazsfliPst2Aq2e10clHV1G21KoU8MZ=w1000-h1000-s-no-gm?authuser=1\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOXW29xldnmsiFn0HOs2h_fdt7MA_TvLmJvh1u2UJwE8E7xYuV5ZJqp0Qhv34j5nMjFDd3PDI5EVq_piFJEvQMpkXznjM3CZM-etBRBg7AikFUJU5P1gFCkmY3uYD1Ub_CbBUr4iRxHREXJF9BT8z0Z=w1261-h1261-s-no-gm?authuser=1\"></p>\n<!-- \ud83d\udd25 TrimUI Smart Pro | Card-style Spec Sheet for Shopify -->\n<div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 20px auto; padding: 20px; border-radius: 14px; background: #ffffff; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); font-family: 'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; color: #1a1a1a; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 6px; color: #111827;\">\ud83d\udd25 TrimUI <span style=\"color: #2563eb;\">Smart Pro</span>\n</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0; color: #6b7280;\">Vita\u2011Style Design \u2022 4.96\" IPS \u2022 A133P \u2022 26+ Emulators \u2022 Wi\u2011Fi Multiplayer</p>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 20px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr)); gap: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #111827; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Design</strong><br>PlayStation Vita\u2013style layout<br>Rounded, ergonomic body</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #ef4444; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Display</strong><br>4.96\" IPS fully laminated<br>720 \u00d7 1280 resolution (294 PPI)</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #fb923c; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Processor (CPU)</strong><br>Allwinner A133P (A133 Plus)<br>Quad\u2011Core Cortex\u2011A53 @ 1.8 GHz</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #f97316; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Graphics (GPU)</strong><br>Imagination PowerVR GE8300<br>660 MHz</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #0ea5e9; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Memory (RAM)</strong><br>1 GB LPDDR4x</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #0284c7; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Storage</strong><br>8 GB eMMC built\u2011in<br>TF Card support: 64 / 128 / 256 GB</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #14b8a6; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Operating System</strong><br>Linux</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #10b981; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Emulation Support</strong><br>26+ emulators supported<br>User\u2011downloadable game formats</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #22c55e; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Wireless</strong><br>Wi\u2011Fi 802.11 b/g/n<br>Online multiplayer support</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #84cc16; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Audio</strong><br>Stereo speakers (2 \u00d7 1W)<br>3.5 mm headphone jack<br>Built\u2011in mono microphone</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #facc15; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Battery</strong><br>5000 mAh lithium battery<br>Up to 5 hours gameplay</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Charging &amp; USB</strong><br>USB\u2011C charging (5V / 1.5A)<br>Supports charging while powered off<br>USB data limited to 500 mA</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #eab308; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Lighting</strong><br>Charging status LED<br>RGB status indicators<br>RGB dual analog stick lighting</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #c084fc; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Ports</strong><br>Top: USB\u2011C Host (controllers)<br>Bottom: USB\u2011C Charging + OTG</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #a855f7; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Extra Features</strong><br>Save/Load states \u2022 Game search<br>Favorites &amp; recent history<br>Single vibration motor</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #64748b; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Dimensions</strong><br>180 \u00d7 80 \u00d7 17 mm</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #334155; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Weight</strong><br>231 g (device only)</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #16a34a; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Reason to Buy</strong><br><span style=\"color: #16a34a; font-weight: 600;\">Smooth 60FPS emulation \u2022 Large IPS screen \u2022 Strong battery</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"font-size: 13px; text-align: center; color: #9ca3af; margin-top: 20px;\">Specifications may vary by configuration and region.</p>\n</div>",
